{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  <u><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Step into a modern world shattered by mystical artifacts. In <strong>Ready Beat Fire</strong>, every action\u2014your shots, enemies, environments, and even buffs\u2014syncs to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot to the rhythm, defeat foes, and evolve your abilities as you battle through dangerous places. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your runs, you'll find artifacts that grant you powers. Explore artifact combinations to create powerful builds.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/ShopAndArtifacts.gif?t=1739929273\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>UNLOCK NEW WAYS TO PLAY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock weapons and abilities, each with its own unique traits and playstyle.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/Weapons.gif?t=1739929273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/extras/QAbility.gif?t=1739929273\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3169600?t=1739929273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3169600?t=1739929273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/44f7520841219074440fa70c2543a9df48591822/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739929273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169600/44f7520841219074440fa70c2543a9df48591822/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739929273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sha